  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 12 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Long Bay, this brand-new residence offers a practical design suited for multi-generational living and modern family life. The thoughtful layout balances convenient shared spaces with well-separated private quarters.\r\n\r\nOn the ground level, a full bedroom suite with its own bathroom and walk-in wardrobe sits near the entry foyer—providing an independent accommodation option for guests or live-in family members. The main open-plan lounge and dining space, anchored by a kitchen with an adjoining scullery, features glass sliders opening onto a private elevated timber deck. A separate deck area from the hallway provides stair access down to the lower lawn, creating an ideal outdoor space for children and family gatherings. This floor also includes a guest powder room and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nThe upper level centers around a versatile second living area featuring a wet bar setup. Accommodation upstairs comprises three bedrooms, including a spacious main master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe and an ensuite shower. Two additional bedrooms share a central family bathroom. A dedicated study space completes this upper level, perfect for working from home or study needs.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Long Bay Beach, regional parkland, and local village amenities, the home also offers convenient driving access to the Albany Park & Ride transit station.\r\n\r\nCombining clean architectural lines, functional space allocation, and modern low-maintenance finishes, this property presents a solid opportunity in a sought-after coastal location.",
